#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:453
msgid "Add a part to the assembly"
msgstr "向装配体添加一个零件"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:455
msgid ""
"Select the desired part or assembly in PartCAD Explorer. After that "
"navigate to the next line under \"``links:``\" and type \"- pa\" (which "
"is what you do when you want to add a child item with the name \"part\") "
"and, then, select the code completion suggestion from PartCAD."
msgstr ""
"在 PartCAD Explorer 中选择所需的零件或装配体。之后，将光标移动到 \"``links:``\" 下方的下一行，输入 \"- "
"pa\"（当你想添加一个名为 \"part\" 的子项时，就是这样操作的），然后从 PartCAD 提供的代码补全建议中进行选择。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:463
msgid "This will add the selected part or assembly to the assembly file."
msgstr "这会将所选的零件或装配体添加到装配体文件中。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:469
msgid "Inspect the assembly"
msgstr "检视装配体"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:471
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When you edit ASSY files in the current PartCAD package, the assembly is "
"displayed automatically on save. Press ``Save`` (Ctrl-S or Cmd-S) to save"
" the assembly file and trigger an automatic inspection of the assembly. "
"The ``PartCAD Viewer`` view will appear on the right if it's not open "
"yet."
msgstr ""
"当你编辑当前 PartCAD 包中的 ASSY 文件时，保存时装配体会自动显示。按 ``Save`` （Ctrl-S 或 "
"Cmd-S）保存装配体文件，并触发对该装配体的自动检视。如果 ``OCP CAD Viewer`` 视图尚未打开，它会出现在右侧。"

